  "body": "<!--\nThank you for contributing to the HTML Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\n-->\nAllow unbounded text track cue duration, as discussed in [whatwg/html issue #5297](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5297).\n\n**Summary**\n\nIt is proposed that a `TextTrackCue.endTime` value of `Infinity` be used to represent an *unbounded time*, i.e. an unspecified future time. This is a simple extension of the existing HTML standard where `media.duration = Infinity` represents the [duration of an unbounded stream](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/media.html#offsets-into-the-media-resource), which is consistent with the definition of unbounded time.\n\n**Implementer Details**\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * [Chromium](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5297#issuecomment-714312870)\n   * [Gecko](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5297#issuecomment-714896640)\n   * [WebKit](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5297#issuecomment-714648026)\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/28394\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/master/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1145620\n   * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1675317\n   * Safari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=218567\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\ncc @chrisn\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5953/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 16, 2021, 5:12 PM UTC (dd843c3)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5953/d79dc8e...dd843c3/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 16, 2021, 5:12 PM UTC (dd843c3)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5953/media.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 16, 2021, 5:12 PM UTC (dd843c3)\">/media.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5953/d79dc8e...dd843c3/media.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 16, 2021, 5:12 PM UTC (dd843c3)\">diff</a> )",
